、株主の皆様をはじめとする関係各位のご支援の賜物であると深く感謝申し上げます。つきましては、当社の財務状況等を総合的に勘案した結果、株主の皆様の日頃のご支援に感謝の意を表し、１株当たり20円の特別配当を実施させていただくことといたしました。これらの結果、2026年９月期の期末配当金は、普通配当140円に特別配当20円を加え、１株当たり160円となる予定であります。　今後におきましても、業績並びに資本効率の向上と持続的な株主還元の強化に向けて全社一丸となり高い成長を遂げられるよう尽力して参りますので、ご支援賜りますよう宜しくお願い申し上げます。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDate", "PreviousReportingDate", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026年4月30日", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 130, "130.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 130, "130.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 160, "160.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 160, "160.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 100, "100.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 100, "100.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2026-09-30", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}